      "b": "<p>用<strong>重复/渐变/对比</strong>制造节奏，像音乐的节拍，引导视线游走。</p><svg class=\"dv-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 235 140\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"30\" width=\"24\" height=\"80\" fill=\"rgb(255,255,255)\"/><rect x=\"35\" y=\"30\" width=\"24\" height=\"80\" fill=\"rgb(227,227,227)\"/><rect x=\"60\" y=\"30\" width=\"24\" height=\"80\" fill=\"rgb(199,199,199)\"/><rect x=\"85\" y=\"30\" width=\"24\" height=\"80\" fill=\"rgb(171,171,171)\"/><rect x=\"110\" y=\"30\" width=\"24\" height=\"80\" fill=\"rgb(143,143,143)\"/><rect x=\"135\" y=\"30\" width=\"24\" height=\"80\" fill=\"rgb(115,115,115)\"/><rect x=\"160\" y=\"30\" width=\"24\" height=\"80\" fill=\"rgb(87,87,87)\"/><rect x=\"185\" y=\"30\" width=\"24\" height=\"80\" fill=\"rgb(59,59,59)\"/><rect x=\"210\" y=\"30\" width=\"24\" height=\"80\" fill=\"rgb(31,31,31)\"/><text x=\"6\" y=\"130\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"#888\">明度阶：左亮→右暗，控制画面节奏</text></svg>"
